<body>

  <h1>💻 Computer Basics</h1>

  <div class="lesson">
    <h2>Casharka 1: Computer waa maxay?</h2>
    <p>
      Computer waa qalab elektaroonig ah oo lagu kaydiyo, lagu farsameeyo
      laguna soo bandhigo xog. Waxaa loo isticmaalaa waxbarasho, shaqo,
      internet, qoraal iyo hawlo kale oo badan.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="lesson">
    <h2>Casharka 2: Qaybaha Computer-ka</h2>
    <p>
      Qaybaha muhiimka ah waxaa ka mid ah Monitor, Keyboard, Mouse iyo
      System Unit. Mid kasta wuxuu leeyahay shaqo gaar ah.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="lesson">
    <h2>Casharka 3: Keyboard-ka</h2>
    <p>
      Keyboard waa qalabka lagu qoro xarfo, tirooyin iyo calaamado.
      Waxaa ka mid ah furayaasha Enter, Space, Backspace iyo Shift.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="lesson">
    <h2>Casharka 4: Mouse-ka</h2>
    <p>
      Mouse waxaa loo isticmaalaa in lagu dhaqaajiyo cursor-ka, lagu
      doorto waxyaabaha ku jira screen-ka, laguna furo files iyo programs.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="lesson">
    <h2>Casharka 5: Files iyo Folders</h2>
    <p>
      File waa xog ama document lagu kaydiyo computer-ka. Folder-na
      waxaa loo isticmaalaa in lagu habeeyo oo lagu kaydiyo files.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="lesson">
    <h2>Casharka 6: Windows iyo Desktop</h2>
    <p>
      Desktop waa meesha ugu weyn ee aad aragto marka computer-ka la shido.
      Windows-na waa operating system loo isticmaalo maamulidda computer-ka.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="lesson">
    <h2>Casharka 7: Internet-ka</h2>
    <p>
      Internet waa shabakad weyn oo isku xirta computers iyo qalab kale.
      Waxaa loo isticmaalaa raadinta macluumaad, waxbarasho iyo isgaarsiinta.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="lesson">
    <h2>Casharka 8: Amniga Computer-ka</h2>
    <p>
      Si computer-ka loo ilaaliyo, isticmaal passwords adag, ha furin
      files aanad garanayn, hana la wadaagin password-kaaga dadka kale.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="lesson">
    <h2>Casharka 9: Microsoft Word</h2>
    <p>
      Microsoft Word waa program loo isticmaalo qorista iyo habaynta
      documents sida waraaqaha, casharrada iyo reports.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="lesson">
    <h2>Casharka 10: Microsoft Excel</h2>
    <p>
      Microsoft Excel waa program lagu sameeyo tables, xisaab iyo
      xog habaysan. Waxaa lagu shaqeeyaa rows iyo columns.
    </p>
  </div>

